1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
Who we are: Jet and Brains

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:03,600
NASA Space Apps Challenge 2026: Space Mission Design Game.
A space mission is a chain of trade-offs. We made a game where you live them.

3
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:05,400
Every Kilogram: design a spacecraft, fly it, bring back the science.

4
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:09,000
Pick your astronaut and a real destination. KILO, your guide, explains the mission.

5
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:10,200
First choose what counts as success.

6
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:13,800
Build it one part at a time, with numbers from real NASA missions.

7
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:15,400
Meet your crew, then launch.

8
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:18,600
The flight is simulated: sunlight, battery, data and radio passes.

9
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:21,800
Land, explore, and scan with the instruments you packed.

10
00:00:21,800 --> 00:00:23,400
Too heavy to get home? Throw science overboard.

11
00:00:23,400 --> 00:00:26,600
Then see why it worked, change one thing, and fly again.

12
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:30,000
Every Kilogram. Play free in the browser: link pending
Next: classroom trials with teachers.
